# Files

Every file a document can hold, in each of its three looks, and every way it can fail. `files.setup.mjs` writes the files beside it.

## Chips in text

The [[Library/files/2026-11/q3-report.a3f9c2e1.pdf|Q3 report]] has the numbers, the [[Library/files/2026-11/gob-deck.a3f9c2e1.pptx|Gob deck.pptx]] has the story, and [[Library/files/2026-11/bracket.a3f9c2e1.stl|the bracket]] is in CAD. A [[Library/files/2026-11/gone.deadbeef.zip|file that is gone]] fades. Notes stay links: [[Roadmap]] and [[Roadmap#Goals]]. A video page in text: [the demo](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ).

